{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "money-manage-api-collection",
    "name": "Money Manage API",
    "description": "Full Postman collection for the money-manage API.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `base_url` to your server (default: `http://localhost:8080`)\n2. Run **Login** — the `auth_token` variable is saved automatically\n3. All protected requests use `{{auth_token}}` in the Authorization header\n\n## Email Sync Flow\n1. **GET** `/api/v2/email-sync/auth` → open the returned `auth_url` in a browser\n2. Google redirects to `/api/v2/email-sync/callback` automatically (no manual call needed)\n3. **POST** `/api/v2/email-sync/sync` → run a sync\n4. **GET** `/api/v2/email-sync/status` → view connection status and logs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "auth_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bank_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "category_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "transaction_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "wallet_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "budget_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "alert_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_token', json.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "logout"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },

